From 2db2079877480958a24470d50f0939d903a58092 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jingze Ma <jingzema0211@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 01:33:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rad_m1 tests: porous photosphere (m1_test = clump)

Held gas over an optically thick base with pseudo-random optically thick
clumps (splitmix64, seed cl_seed), the same cell field bitwise for any
MeshBlock layout, rank or thread count; cl_smooth gives the smooth layer
of the same row-mean opacity.  Decks: Cartesian with SC rays, and a
spherical-polar thin shell (r 100..101) for the FV rays of vet_gd.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
